  ('reading-tanakadays', '田中さんの毎日', E'田中さんは毎朝七時に起きて、朝ご飯を食べます。午前は大学で勉強します。午後は図書館で本を三冊読みます。夜、友達と駅の近くの店で晩ご飯を食べて、九時に家へ帰ります。', 'Tanaka gets up at seven every morning and eats breakfast. In the morning, he studies at university. In the afternoon, he reads three books at the library. At night, he eats dinner with a friend at a shop near the station and returns home at nine.', array['vocab-tanaka','vocab-maiasa','vocab-shichiji','vocab-okiru','vocab-asagohan','vocab-taberu','vocab-gozen','vocab-daigaku','vocab-benkyou','vocab-gogo','vocab-toshokan','vocab-hon','vocab-sansatsu','vocab-yoru','vocab-tomodachi','vocab-eki','vocab-chikaku','vocab-mise','vocab-bangohan','vocab-kuji','vocab-kaeru'], array['grammar-wa','grammar-ni','grammar-de','grammar-counters','grammar-masu','grammar-te-form'], array['kanji-asa','kanji-ji','kanji-go-noon','kanji-gaku','kanji-doku','kanji-sho','kanji-mai','kanji-shuu'], 3)
